C in Delta County","/arc-plc/colorado/delta-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, May to June has come in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 the middle got 46% of normal in April to May and 127% in September to October. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 45% on the middle. Every grid here had its driest year in 2020, and grid 22287 got 46% of normal that year.</p>"}
